  "battlefield": {
    "_doc": "Group combat (Phase 4). Soldiers fight from approach slots around a target instead of its exact position: slot_count positions at slot_radius (kept inside sword reach), at most max_per_target blades on one target (max_per_leader on the commander) and max_per_sector from any one 90-degree direction, with open_slots always left free. A soldier whose target is ringed waits at wait_radius for a slot, then finds another fight. personal_space = preferred distance between friends. assist_radius = how far a free soldier looks for a friend still fighting. leader_danger = commander health fraction below which nearby allies prioritise his attackers. spawn_* = how battle squads are laid out (spacing, jitter, minimum gap between any two spawns); lane_distance = how far in front of the defenders each enemy squad's approach point lies.",
